<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="rv">Two conversations,<br />one room.</h2>
      <span class="sec-num">01 — The premise</span>
    </div>
    <div class="two rv">
      <div>
        <div class="tag">The builders</div>
        <h3>How AI works</h3>
        <p>
          Models, tools, capabilities, speed. The people shipping the systems; what's actually possible this quarter,
          and what's still hype.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="tag">The leaders</div>
        <h3>What AI means</h3>
        <p>
          For creativity, culture, jobs and decision-making. The marketers, creatives and leaders putting these systems
          to work in the real world.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="merge rv">Most events pick a lane. humAIn brings them together.</p>
    <div class="frame rv">
      <h3>One room. A shared frame of reference.</h3>
      <p>
        AI conversations often happen at different altitudes. Technical possibility, creative ambition and business
        reality can feel like separate discussions.
      </p>
      <p>
        humAIn brings them together. Our single-stream conference gives everyone a shared foundation: the same talks,
        different perspectives and the opportunity to question assumptions together.
      </p>
      <p>
        We build a common language for what the technology can do, what it means for our work and where human judgement
        matters. That understanding carries into the roundtables, the conversations between sessions and the decisions
        we make afterwards.
      </p>
      <p>
        We don’t need to agree on everything. But we make more progress when we share an altitude.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-cta rv">
      <a href="/programme" class="btn"><span class="dot"></span>Explore the programme →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


